For Learning Agentic AI

A good progression is:

✅ Single Agent
✅ Two-Agent System
✅ Sequential Workflow
✅ Parallel Workflow
✅ Group Chat
✅ Hierarchical
✅ Planner–Executor
✅ Planner–Executor–Reviewer
✅ Router Pattern
✅ Reflection & Critic
✅ Human-in-the-Loop
✅ Swarm / Blackboard (advanced)

This progression takes you from the simplest coordination pattern to the more advanced designs used in production multi-agent systems.

